# Cloudflare Pages — security headers for every route.
# Note: asset cache freshness is handled by versioned ?v= URLs in index.html.
# Pages ignores _headers Cache-Control on static assets (enforces max-age=14400),
# so cache directives are intentionally NOT set here.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), browsing-topics=()
